  "he:Lag BaOmer Songs/Amar Rabbi Akiva:2": {
   "kind": "heading",
   "en": "Rabbi Akiva said"
  },
  "he:Lag BaOmer Songs/Amar Rabbi Akiva:3": {
   "kind": "prayer",
   "en": "Rabbi Akiva said: Blessed are you, Israel, before whom do you purify yourselves, and who purifies you? Your Father in heaven. And it says: 'The hope of Israel is the Lord.' Just as a mikvah purifies the impure, so too the Holy One, blessed be He, purifies Israel."
  },
